        "name": "Vault Breaker",
        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "Vi charges her gauntlets and unleashes a vault shattering punch, carrying her forward. Enemies she hits are knocked back and receive a stack of Denting Blows.",
        "bodyHtml": "<span>Begin Charging:</span> Vi begins charging a powerful punch, <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Slowing</span> herself by 15%.<br /><br /><span>Release:</span> Vi dashes forward dealing between <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(40/60/80/100/120 + (60% bonus Attack Damage)) and (100/150/200/250/300 + (150% bonus Attack Damage)) physical damage</span> based on charge time and applying <span>Denting Blows</span> to all enemies hit. Vi stops upon colliding with an enemy champion, and <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Knocks</span> them <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Back</span>.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Non-champions hit are pulled towards Vi.<br />If the charge is interrupted, this Ability goes on a 3 second Cooldown.</span>",
