        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "Vi's punches break her opponent's Armor, dealing bonus damage and granting her Attack Speed.",
        "bodyHtml": "<span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-500 italic\">Passive:</span> Every 3rd Attack on the same target deals an additional <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(4/5/6/7/8% + (3.5% per 100 bonus Attack Damage)) max Health physical damage</span>, removes <span class=\"text-orange-600 dark:text-orange-400\">20% Armor</span> and grants Vi <span>30/35/40/45/50% Attack Speed</span> for 4 seconds. It also reduces the remaining Cooldown of <span>Blast Shield</span> by 4 seconds.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Deals a maximum of <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">300 damage</span> against jungle monsters.</span>",
